descriptionByLocale.it:
Do you enjoy working in dynamic teams? Are you excited by the opportunity to work on a diverse loan portfolio? Are you solution oriented? We’re looking for someone like that who can:
• work with the Leveraged Capital Markets and Structured Solutions team to help manage the Australian loan portfolio;
• be across all aspects of the ongoing monitoring and administration of the loan portfolio, working closely with the front office Leveraged Capital Markets and Structured Solutions team, credit risk control and the loan operations team
• prepare monthly and quarterly reports on the loan portfolio for senior management and credit risk officers;
• assist the team with preparation of credit submissions, conducting due diligence, reviewing ongoing financial reporting and analysing borrower requests; and
• have regular dialogue with borrowers to understand their business, financial reporting and monitor the loan’s performance.

